# Commits are unsigned

When creating a git commit, pass `--no-gpg-sign`.

Signing is enabled in git config, and the passphrase prompt times out in this environment. Do not change git config. Do not pass `--no-verify`.

```bash
git commit --no-gpg-sign -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Commit message here.

EOF
)"
```
